 "remarks": "Welcome to an exceptional North Stamford estate offering impressive space, privacy and flexibility on 2 landscaped acres. This custom contemporary ranch offers approx. 7,000 sq. ft. above grade plus nearly 3,000 sq. ft. of finished lower-level and bonus space. With 7 bedrooms, 6 full and 2 half baths, the thoughtfully designed layout is ideal for multigenerational living, extended family or a live-in au pair. Separate living areas, including space with a private entrance, offer independence and privacy while remaining connected to the main residence. Soaring vaulted ceilings, 9ft+ ceilings throughout, a first-floor en-suite, generous room sizes and multiple formal and informal living areas create an impressive yet functional home. The exceptional size and flow provide flexibility for everyday living, working from home and entertaining, from intimate gatherings to larger events. An expansive raised stone patio extends the living space outdoors. Rarely does a property combine this amount of above-grade living space, additional finished and bonus space, privacy and true multigenerational flexibility, all within convenient reach of downtown Stamford, schools, shopping and commuter routes. A unique opportunity to own a home that can adapt to your needs today and for generations to come.",
